=> the joint prior asks for 4.41x the modulation the mode accepts (3.52x off the LO bracket)

NOTE the reported prior_z in the arm file disagrees with the analytic z
above (it puts A_T at +3.29 and q10 at -2.01). run_modefind_pump_arms.R's
prior_z() integrates the prior on a LINEAR grid from x/1e3 to x*1e3, which
for a tight lognormal on a large x resolves the prior with ~1 grid point.
The analytic values are the correct ones. Reported, not silently used.

