READING THIS
------------
flat in loglik AND in seasonal-4        -> ridge confirmed; sec.2's repair is aimed right
flat in seasonal-4, NOT in `rest`       -> the ridge is real but q10's ANNUAL duty pays;
                                           the repair is splitting q10, not re-anchoring a prior
flat in neither                         -> not a ridge; STOP, sec.2 is wrong

